ing a foot injury and she eventually dropped out of the final, after leading the first seven laps. That left a stunned field to battle for the medals. After her withdrawal, the lead was taken by " [:a {:href "/athletes/68715"} "Liz McColgan"] " (GBR), " [:a {:href "/athletes/70122"} "Kathrin Ullrich"] " (GDR), " [:a {:href "/athletes/77312"} "Yelena Zhupiyeva"] " (URS), and " [:a {:href "/athletes/77165"} "Olga Bondarenko"] " (URS). Ullrich led at 5K, but McColgan then pushed the pace and Ullrich could not maintain it after 8,000 metres. Zhupiyeva hung on until 9K, but the race then came down to McColgan and Bondarenko. With 200 left, Bondarenko pushed past McColgan and pulled away from her for the gold medal."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "514"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/77165"} "Olga Bondarenko"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} "31:47.67 (2 h1)"] [:td {} "31:05.21 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "label label-default"} [:abbrev {:title "Olympic Record"} "OR"]]] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "231"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/68715"} "Liz McColgan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} "32:11.95 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "31:08.44 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "526"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/77312"} "Yelena Zhupiyeva"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:im